# Minimal .forceignore for generic CI/CD pipeline
# Only ignore what truly cannot be deployed

package.xml

# LWC configuration files
**/jsconfig.json
**/.eslintrc.json

# LWC Jest tests
**/__tests__/**

node_modules/

# ==========================================
# Org-Specific Metadata (Cannot be deployed)
# ==========================================

# Salesforce Internal/Managed Permission Sets
**/permissionsets/sfdcInternalInt__*
**/permissionsets/force__*

# SAML and Security (org-specific)
**/samlssoconfigs/**

# System metadata
**/appMenus/**
**/installedPackages/**
